{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06089","headline":"游感化寺 · 王维","name":"游感化寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翡翠香烟合，琉璃宝地平。\n龙宫连栋宇，虎穴傍檐楹。\n谷静唯松响，山深无鸟声。\n琼峰当户拆，金涧透林明。\n郢路云端逈，秦川雨外晴。\n鴈王衔果献，鹿女踏花行。\n抖擞辞贫里，归依宿化城。\n绕篱生野蕨，空馆发山樱。\n香饭青菰米，嘉蔬绿笋茎。\n誓陪清梵末，端坐学无生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}